  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Click Botswana PDC planeringsbidrag</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Click Botswana PDC planning grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A planning grant private between Soft Solution Partner AB in Sweden   and Philpride Ltd in Botswana. The project will enable development of Click-Botswana, aiming at educating and informing citizens on current topics in Botswana. The partnership is assessed to be able to         strengthen the long term ICT development in Botswana.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett planeringsbidrag f&#xf6;r akt&#xf6;rssamverkan (privata akt&#xf6;rer) d&#xe4;r ett    samarbete mellan Soft Solutions Partner AB i Sverige och Philpride    Education Ltd i Botswana ska utveckla webbportalen Click-Botswana     vilken &#xe4;mnar att utbilda och informera inv&#xe5;nare om Botswana och       str&#xe4;ka en l&#xe5;ngsiktig ICT utveckling.</narrative>
  </description>
